    <string name="about_body">I-BenSuet Stay isita bafundzi baseNingizimu Afrika kutfola indzawo yekuhlala lephephile nelecinisekisiwe eduze nekhampasi yabo, netindzawo te-NSFAS netekutikhokhela endzaweni yinye. Yakhiwe yi-Mansuet Dev.</string>
