    <string name="delete_account">Sula i-akhawunti yami</string>
    <string name="delete_account_subtitle">Susa phakadze iphrofayili yakho nekungena</string>
    <string name="delete_account_confirm_title">Sula i-akhawunti yakho?</string>
    <string name="delete_account_confirm_body">Loku kusula phakadze iphrofayili yakho ye-BenSuet Stay nekungena kwakho. Loku angeke kubuyiselwe emuva.</string>
    <string name="account_deleted">I-akhawunti yakho isusiwe.</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_body">I-BenSuet Stay icoca kuphela loko lekudzingako kute ixhumanise bafundzi netindzawo tekuhlala.\n\nLesikucocako: libito lakho, i-imeyili, likheli lasekhaya, sikhungo neluhlobo lwekusekelwa. Nawufaka sicelo selikamelo sigcina nenombolo yakho yemazisi ye-SA, inombolo yemfundzi, ikhampasi, imininingwane yesihlobo lesiseduze nemabito emadokhumenti lowakhetsile. Kubanikati betindlu: libito, i-imeyili nenombolo yelucingo.\n\nNgobe yini: kukhombisa tindzawo letifanele, kuvumela banikati betindlu kutsi baphatse kubuka neticelo takho, nekukutfumelela tibuyeketo ngato.\n\nNgubani longakubona: nguwe kuphela, umnikati wendlu wendzawo loxhumana nayo, nebaphatsi be-BenSuet Stay. Imitsetfo yekuphepha yesigcinamininingwane setfu icinisekisa loku.\n\nLapho kugcinwa khona: Google Firebase (Cloud Firestore, sifundza saseGoli). Emaphasiwedi aphatfwa yi-Firebase Authentication futsi akagcinwa yi-app.\n\nEmalungelo akho ngaphansi kwe-POPIA: ungabuka uphindze uvuselele imininingwane yakho ku-Tilungiselelo, futsi usule i-akhawunti yakho nobe nini ku-Tilungiselelo → Imfihlo → Sula i-akhawunti yami. Kulokunye, sebentisa Tilungiselelo → Lusito → Xhumana nelusito.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q1">Ngikubhuka njani kubuka indzawo?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a1">Vula sikhangiso bese ucindzetela Bhukela kubuka, bese ukhetsa lilanga nesikhatsi. Umnikati wendlu uyakucinisekisa noma akwale, futsi utfola satiso nobe kunjani.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q2">Ngisifaka njani sicelo selikamelo?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a2">Vula sikhangiso, khetsa luhlobo lwelikamelo bese ucindzetela Khetsa likamelo. Bafundzi be-NSFAS bacinisekisa imininingwane yabo ye-NSFAS; labatikhokhelako bengeta imininingwane yesihlobo lesiseduze nemadokhumenti abo. Silandzelele ku-Tilungiselelo → Ticelo tami.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q3">Ngingayisebentisa yini i-app ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a3">Yebo. Tikhangiso losewutivulile tihlala tibonakala, futsi ticelo tekubuka noma ticelo lotentile ungekho ku-inthanethi tigcinwa elucingweni lwakho bese titfunyelwa ngekutentekela nawuphindze uxhumane.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q4">Kungani ngingaboni tonkhe tindzawo tekuhlala?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a4">Likhasi lasekhaya licala ngeluhlobo lwakho lwekusekelwa futsi Eduze nekhampasi yami kuvuliwe. Cindzetela Konkhe noma Eduze nekhampasi yami kute ukhulise kusesha, noma ushintje loku ku-Tilungiselelo → Sikrini sasekhaya.</string>
    <string name="faq_l_q1">Ngubani lodala futsi alungise tikhangiso tami?</string>
    <string name="faq_l_a1">Licembu lebaphatsi be-BenSuet Stay lidala tikhangiso bese likuniketa tona. Kute ushintje sikhangiso noma imininingwane yakho, sebentisa Xhumana nelusito, noma Cela lushintjo ngaphansi kwe-Imininingwane yakho.</string>
    <string name="faq_l_q2">Ngiticondzisa njani ticelo tekubuka?</string>
    <string name="faq_l_a2">Vula Kubhuka bese ucinisekisa noma wale sicelo ngasinye. Nawala, nika sizatfu bese uphakamisa lesinye sikhatsi. Umfundzi watiswa masinyane.</string>
    <string name="faq_l_q3">Kwentekani nangivuma sicelo?</string>
    <string name="faq_l_a3">Sikhala sinye sisuswa kulolo hlobo lwelikamelo ngekutentekela, futsi umfundzi ubona linothi lakho ku-Ticelo tami.</string>
</resources>
